<plain>
<text x="114.3" y="-83.82" size="2.54" layer="97">Revisions:
1.0.1 - TQFP44 pin39 was not connected
           (should always use ERC!)
1.0.2 - add rows of common holes for ground and vcc
            adjust xtal capacitor footprint
            add ground plane</text>
<text x="114.3" y="-88.9" size="2.54" layer="97">a variant - narrower 44 pin layout. + some odds and sods</text>
</plain>
